   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«A se trezi»",
     "texto": [
      "The infinitive **a se trezi** means «to wake up». In the present tense, the pronoun changes: **mă trezesc, te trezești, se trezește, ne trezim, vă treziți, se trezesc**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Word order",
     "texto": [
      "The reflexive pronoun goes before the verb: **Mă trezesc dimineața** («I wake up in the morning»). It is never attached to the end of the verb: it is always a separate word placed before it."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Morning or tomorrow?",
     "texto": [
      "**Dimineață** is the morning; **mâine** means «tomorrow» (the next day). They are different words."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
